Crack Attack! — Back From The Stack (Rust / WebGPU rewrite, 2.x)
Copyright (C) 2026 Thiosaur

This program is a rewrite in Rust of Crack Attack! 1.1.14, and therefore a derivative
work of it. The game logic, constants and many names come from the original C++ code,
which was translated and modified starting in January 2026. Crack Attack! 1.1.14 is
licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or (at your option) any later
version; this derivative work is distributed under version 3 or (at your option) any
later version (see LICENSE).


